                                                "sense_id": "858a2847-b97a-3546-adaf-9ebd099929a9",
                                                "text": "However, a National-Act coalition would only have a slim majority, meaning Mr Luxon may need to secure the support of NZ First, whose leader Winston Peters has been kingmaker in previous Labour and National-led coalitions."
                                            }
                                        ]
